  "textLength": 3394,
  "text": "SKIP TO CONTENT\nSHOP\nSUBSCRIPTIONS\nONE SMALL STEP\nSTORY\nFAQS\nLOG IN\nCART\nTRY YOUR LUCK\nScratch below to see what you win\nYou've unlocked\n20% OFF\nNo, thanks\nTHE LION'S MANE DRINKS COMPANY\nSupporting your mind and body, without compromising on taste.\nSHOP NOW\nORGANIC LION'S MANE\nVITAMIN A&D\nLOW SUGAR\nSHOP BY CATEGORY\nCANS\nELIXIRS\nMINIS (FOR KIDS)\nFEEL AND PERFORM AT YOUR BEST, WHENEVER, WHEREVER.\nLion’s Mane creates a calm kind of clarity by supporting neuroplasticity. Phasing out the mental fog, so you feel ready to take your next step.\nWHERE FLAVOUR MEETS FUNCTION\nFUEL YOUR FOCUS\nPROMOTE GUT HEALTH\nBOOST YOUR IMMUNITY\nBRITISH LION'S MANE\nNATURALLY HIGH FIBRE\nVEGAN & GLUTEN FREE\nGET INSPIRED\nRASPBERRY & LYCHEE ELIXIR\n£26.99\nADD TO CART\nBLOOD ORANGE & GINGER ELIXIR\n£26.99\nADD TO CART\nRASPBERRY & LYCHEE CAN (12 X 250ML)\n£23.00\nADD TO CART\n▼\nBLOOD ORANGE & GINGER CAN (12 X 250ML)\n£23.00\nADD TO CART\n▼\nCRAFTED IN CAMBRIDGESHIRE.\nWe use the highest quality ingredients – carefully sourced for full flavour and full function. Low in natural sugars, free from artificial sweeteners and packed with chicory root fibre.\nMUUSH MOMENTS\nSUBSCRIBE AND GET 20% OFF\nSUBSCRIBE\nWHAT PEOPLE ARE SAYING 👀\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\nRECOMMEND DELICIOUS AND HEALTHY\n\"Love the taste. I drink with sparkling water . The Raspberry and Lychee has a fruity taste. It is sweet without being sickly and I do feel like I am relaxed and in a good mood. I like drinking it when I am working in a large wine glass. It is also low calorie and encourages me to increase my water intake .Definitely worth a try and if you don’t like then give it to me 🤣\"\nChristineAngelmagik2\nRaspberry and Lychee Elixir\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\nNEW FAVOURITE DRINK\n\"Having loved the original flavours my daughter and I just had to try the new Sicilian lemonade. Wow, new child favourite unlocked!! What a refreshing flavour with just the right amount of zing and fizzy with the awesome bonus of lions Mane. My daughter no longer looks for coke, Fanta or energy drinks, she just looks for Muush and she loves all the flavours!! Keep up the good work guys!!\"\nMartin Mitchell\nSicilian lemonade Cans\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\nLOVELY DRINK AND GEAT BENEFITS.\n\"Love this drink. It is very refreshing and has a great taste of ginger. It taste natural and not artificial. All the health benefits of this drink are states all over the packaging. It is great drinking a fizzy drink without the guilt. However, the drink taste \"healthy\" as in tIs has no sweetness to it and there is mainly a taste of ginger which is not too strong either.\"\nDaxian\nBlood Orange & Ginger Cans\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\nTHE PERFECT WAY TO ENJOY LIONS MANE\n\"The blood orange and ginger is a punchy, refreshing flavour mixed with ice and chilled soda water - I love the warmth from the ginger and having the ability to pour my own measures. The ingredients are top quality and the team behind the product are so passionate and knowledgeable that you’ll be hooked once you try it.\"\nDeanna Murray\nBlood Orange & Ginger Elixir\nPRODUCTS\nCans\nElixirs\nMinis\nStock Us\nABOUT\nOur Story\nOur Blogs\nMUUSH Missions\nSUPPORT\nFAQs\nReturns\nDelivery\nContact\nMy Subscriptions\nTrack My Order\nSUBSCRIBE TO OUR EMAILS\nEmail\nFACEBOOK\nINSTAGRAM\nYOUTUBE\nCOUNTRY/REGION\nUnited Kingdom | GBP £\nPayment methods\n© 2026, MUUSH Powered By Shopify\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms Of Service\nRefund Policy\nContact Information\nCancellation Policy",
